Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:41:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Part 2: fill short gaps and drop duplicate readings

GapFiller tracks the last seq per device:
- same seq again (QoS 1 redelivery) -> dropped
- 1-3 missing readings -> linearly interpolated, marked "filled": true
- longer gaps -> logged, not filled
- seq going backwards (simulator restart) -> state reset
GAP_FILL=false turns it off for the broker-restart / Azure-outage tests.
train.py skips filled rows so the models learn from real readings only.

